      "id": "minimal",
      "description": "The smallest catalog MSF-00 admits: the two root fields marked Required: Yes (version 5.1.1, a Number; tracks 5.1.8) and the three track fields marked Required: Yes (name 5.1.11, packaging 5.1.12, isLive 5.1.15). Version 1 is the one this document describes (Section 1). No namespace, so the track inherits the catalog track's (5.1.10).",
      "input": {
        "text": "{\"version\": 1, \"tracks\": [{\"name\": \"video\", \"packaging\": \"loc\", \"isLive\": true}]}"
      },
      "resolved": {
        "version": 1,
        "tracks": [
          {
            "name": "video",
            "packaging": "loc",
            "isLive": true
          }
        ]
      }
